{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415804","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415804","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041580401:1":{"text":"啊，一位战场幸存者，有着无比坚韧的灵魂。","source_cn":"啊，一位战场幸存者，有着无比坚韧的灵魂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA351AA0FF114793C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580402:1":{"text":"班题斯的亡灵……！","source_cn":"班题斯的亡灵……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8190C5F31A9E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580403:1":{"text":"呵呵，看来你认识那群战争狂。","source_cn":"呵呵，看来你认识那群战争狂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA568188772156EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580404:1":{"text":"放心，我和他们不同。但凡他们有我一半的理智，我也不至于数次搬家。","source_cn":"放心，我和他们不同。但凡他们有我一半的理智，我也不至于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1A9FC3CA25D715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580405:1":{"text":"我无意与生者争斗，你可以放下武器。","source_cn":"我无意与生者争斗，你可以放下武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895FEBE0A7EEB2FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580406:1":{"text":"你无权命令我，亡灵。","source_cn":"你无权命令我，亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA4E23D9480382A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580407:1":{"text":"真是令人怀念的语气。你一定在军队待过，而且曾经和班题斯交手。","source_cn":"真是令人怀念的语气。你一定在军队待过，而且曾经和班题斯交手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA0C082479B6D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580408:1":{"text":"站姿、步态、眼神，还有下意识的警惕……你还是最出色的那类。","source_cn":"站姿、步态、眼神，还有下意识的警惕……你还是最出色的那类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1969BF25D97CC023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580409:1":{"text":"……你也是军人？","source_cn":"……你也是军人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38DA8A2832B8E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580410:1":{"text":"姑且算是吧。我生前是个军医，救过很多像你这样的人。当然，也有许多没能了却的遗憾。","source_cn":"姑且算是吧。我生前是个军医，救过很多像你这样的人。当然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5E3E90FBF2639FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580411:1":{"text":"……战场之事向来如此。但听你的口气，不像是释怀了。","source_cn":"……战场之事向来如此。但听你的口气，不像是释怀了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18A8BE8130AF30C1","varian